- [communication/serial_comm.py](file:///home/mert/hss_ws/src/prototip_ros2/prototip_ros2/communication/serial_comm.py) — olduğu gibi kopyalanır
- [detection/yolo_detector.py](file:///home/mert/hss_ws/src/prototip_ros2/prototip_ros2/detection/yolo_detector.py) — genişletilir (renk/sınıf desteği)

#### [NEW] [celikubbe_launch.py](file:///home/mert/hss_ws/src/celikubbe_ros2/launch/celikubbe_launch.py)
